{"id":"wb-8-133","name":"大甸山遗址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"大甸山遗址","text":"大甸山遗址位于云南省保山市昌宁县田园镇，是一处春秋时期至汉代的遗址。遗址总面积约59万平方米，包括大甸山墓地、东甸山墓地、营盘山遗址、大横山遗址。大甸山遗址的文化内涵不同于滇文化，可能是哀牢国中心邑聚。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%A4%A7%E7%94%B8%E5%B1%B1%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80","revisionId":90815364,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=90815364","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/720012c4800c24a4bbef3aef.jpg","title":"大甸山遗址_-_航拍_-_2024-05-31_05.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%A4%A7%E7%94%B8%E5%B1%B1%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80_-_%E8%88%AA%E6%8B%8D_-_2024-05-31_05.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/53/%E5%A4%A7%E7%94%B8%E5%B1%B1%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80_-_%E8%88%AA%E6%8B%8D_-_2024-05-31_05.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"瑞丽江的河水","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​大甸山遗址航拍","width":320,"height":180}}